---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy & Inquiry Data | Yukun" noIndex={true}>
  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] space-y-4">
        <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> July 2026</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you submit an RFQ or sample request through our website, we collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Name, company name, email address, country, and phone number (if provided)</li>
          <li>Product interests and technical requirements you share with us</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use your information solely to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Respond to your inquiry with product recommendations and quotations</li>
          <li>Process sample requests and orders</li>
          <li>Communicate about your project requirements</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">3. Form and Email Processing</h2>
        <p>If the optional website form is configured and used, the submission is processed through Web3Forms. Direct email inquiries are processed by the relevant email service. We retain inquiry data only as needed for communication, evaluation, and reasonable business records.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">4. Analytics</h2>
        <p>This website uses Google Analytics to understand aggregate visits and inquiry conversions. Your browser settings and applicable consent controls may affect analytics data collection.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">5. Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy-related inquiries, contact us at <a href="mailto:chinajpq@outlook.com" class="text-[var(--color-brand-light)]">chinajpq@outlook.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
